@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
### Paste your own sb-...-auth-token cookie value here before running requests.
### (A real captured session token used to live directly in this file — replaced
### with a placeholder so a live credential doesn't sit in source control.)
@authCookie = sb-hmbemyfaqnkiamvhcdcd-auth-token=PASTE_YOUR_SESSION_COOKIE_HERE

### Get the logged-in user's profile (legacy route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/profile
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### --- Auth / User ---

### Get own profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/me
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### Update own profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user/me
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Cezara"
}

### Delete own account (irreversible)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/user/me
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### --- Study Settings ---

### Get study settings (404 before onboarding)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/study-settings
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### Update study settings
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/study-settings
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new_kanji_per_day": 5,
  "enabled_levels": ["N5", "N4"]
}

### --- Onboarding ---

### Complete onboarding (creates user_study_settings)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/onboarding/complete
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled_levels": ["N5"],
  "new_kanji_per_day": 2,
  "new_vocab_per_day": 12
}

### --- Kanji / Vocabulary (no auth required) ---

### List kanji
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kanji?level=N5&limit=20

### Search kanji (substring match on kanji/meanings/readings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kanji?search=day

### Get one kanji + up to 3 associated words
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kanji/1

### List vocabulary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vocabulary?level=N5&limit=20

### Search vocabulary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vocabulary?search=day

### Get one vocabulary word
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vocabulary/1

### --- Core SRS ---

### Get today's study queue (due cards + new candidates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/study/queue
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### Introduce a new kanji (creates meaning + up to 3 reading progress rows)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/kanji/introduce
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kanji_id": 1
}

### Introduce a new vocabulary word
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/vocabulary/introduce
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "word_id": 1
}

### Submit a review (rating 0-3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/review
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise_type": "kanji_meaning",
  "kanji_id": 1,
  "rating": 2
}

### Undo the most recent review
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/review/undo
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Get study stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/study/stats
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### --- Study Sessions ---

### Start a study session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/session/start
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### End a study session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/study/session/end
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": 1
}

### --- Progress ---

### Progress summary (counts by status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/summary
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### Progress for one kanji (meaning + readings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/kanji/1
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### Progress for one vocabulary word
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/vocabulary/1
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### --- Card control ---

### Suspend a card (type: meaning | reading | vocab)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cards/meaning/1/suspend
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### Reset a card to 'new'
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cards/meaning/1/reset
Cookie: {{authCookie}}

### --- Stripe ---

### Start checkout for premium
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stripe/create-checkout-session
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Open the billing portal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stripe/create-portal-session
Cookie: {{authCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Webhook is called by Stripe directly (use `stripe listen --forward-to` locally), not from here.

### --- Utility ---

### Health check (DB connectivity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
